        <outline text="Embedded REST API [EE]" _note="EE REST modules for the embedded iPaaS: internal (/api/embedded/internal/**), public (/api/embedded/v1/**), and frontend (/api/embedded/frontend/v1/**) API groups spanning configuration, connected users, executions, webhooks, unified API, and security.">
          <outline text="embedded-configuration-rest / -public-rest / -remote-rest"/>
